{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28046","headline":"赋愁 · 魏扶","name":"赋愁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"愁，逈野，深秋。\n生枕上，起眉头。\n闺合危坐，风尘远游。\n巴猨啼不住，谷水咽还流。\n送客泊舟入浦，思乡望月登楼。\n烟波早晚长羁旅，弦管终年乐五侯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"魏扶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28046.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28046","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}